<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1TI" style="id">- Ibaas</book>
  <para style="h">1 ATimoti</para>
  <para style="toc3">1ATim</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 ATimoti</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kufumung imɛsɛng fɛ́ aBulus Jɛk sak na aTimoti</para>
  <para style="mt1">1 ATimoti</para>
  <para style="mt2">Kufumung imɛsɛng fɛ́ aBulus <optbreak /> Jɛk sak na aTimoti</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TI 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 1:1" />Kufumung e ne na aBulus atom aYeso Kristi, ni itak Adakunom, Anet-Isheshek yit nɛ aYeso Kristi, fɛ́ a yet ite iyɛ yit, <verse eid="1TI 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 1:2" />sak ni ngɔn aTimoti, fi i yet nggon in ka fɛ́ atsak na abik: Won itek, angmishish ni kusonong kukyang fi ku nes na Ada yit Adakunom nɛ Anet-Isheshek aYeso Kristi na aTisa yit, ni ku sot ni ngɔn.<verse eid="1TI 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ikɔrɔk kuto azaton bafi itees <optbreak /> Ntsi mbɔɔs</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 1:3" />Kpaf ti in kin di fɛ̀ ni ngɔn ni izen fi in kin se ni irèn sak na aMasedoniya, ye ni in sot na Afisa nɔng i da tak banet bakak fok da ba bi tɛ ba ya kashon ni fok itees fi iyet in fi mbɔɔs awo, <verse eid="1TI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 1:4" />da ba nɔɔk ice bá ni nkyɛng-ashon ashon ni ifa ayerek bashɔn ari fɛ́ a se vit nkum awo. Inye anɔng e bes na nanan aza kutomong Adakunom fɛ́ ba rèn iko nabik. <verse eid="1TI 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 1:5" />Isak iyɛ kucɛɛt kang yet, ishim fi ines ayɛt iyɛ fi i se cɛ́l ni kuyiring kutek nɛ kabik atsak. <verse eid="1TI 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 1:6" />Banet bakak mi te rɛɛt ni ikuus nkyɔrɔk nang, ba mi tirik sak iras ncɛɛt abap. <verse eid="1TI 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 1:7" />Ba shim ba sot bafi itees ntsi, awɛt da ba ne ba rēn ikyɛng fɛ́ ba cɛɛt naton e awo, ngma na anɔng na ba di fit tɛ ba rēn ide gyet awo.<verse eid="1TI 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 1:8" />In rēn yit fok ntsi se gyat, ke anet ra kutomong ni ina ni irèn itek. <verse eid="1TI 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 1:9" />In ti in rēn yit fok, da ba te ntsi nek bayɔng fɛ́ ba nye kusot kutabat awo, tit nek bayɔng fɛ́ ba se gbakasak nɛ bafi idoro nhwyɛ, nɛ bayɔng fɛ́ vit iba ni nnyim Adakunom nɛ bafi inɛn, nɛ bayɔng fɛ́ vit iba na ajɛrɛ nɛ bayɔng fɛ́ vit iba ni irèn ikuus; nɛ bafi ifɛɛs bada ni binggɔ, nɛ bafi ifɛɛs banet. <verse eid="1TI 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 1:10" />Na bafi iras irɔs, nɛ batek fɛ́ ba mereng na batek, nɛ banet fɛ́ ba yising nɛ ba rɛɛs banet, nɛ bafi mbɔɔs, nɛ bafi inesek kanu mbɔɔs nɛ ngma ikyɛng fi i se zɛɛt ni itees atsak <verse eid="1TI 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 1:11" />fi i se kpaf ni ishara ifɛ̀ itek, ifɛ́ azɔk Adakunom, fi iwu di nabak e.<verse eid="1TI 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Itek fɛ́ Adakunom nye <optbreak /> aBulus e</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 1:12" />Ifeng hom sak na aKristi Yeso aTisa yit, fɛ́ a di nɔɔk agap, a di fok imi kyem, a di kasa ni in ra kutomong wu. <verse eid="1TI 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 1:13" />Ngma ni fi imi tsang yet afi ibeseng iyerek wu, afi inesek izot nɛ anet ifa, ngma na anɔng, a di tonong angmishish nek imi ras nkyɔrɔk e yɔng ni idun nɛ avit atsak. <verse eid="1TI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 1:14" />ATisa yit di shining ni itek wu makiyi, ngma ni inɔɔk atsak, ni ishim fi i se ayɛt Anet-Isheshek aYeso.<verse eid="1TI 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 1:15" />Ifɛ̀ de yet atsak, i se gyat na ba shan ide ni iyɛ izining: Ifɛ̀ me se ane: Anet-Isheshek aYeso bɛ azatse nek isheshek bafi inɛn, ayɛt bá imi wu in dung ka ba wat ni inɛn. <verse eid="1TI 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 1:16" />Awɛt ngma na anɔng, a di tonong angmishish nɔng ayɛt in, imi fi in ka ba wat ni inɛn, Anet-Isheshek aYeso di ki tonong akabɔk wu fɛ́ a se vit nkum, nek a di sot ikyɛng itees sak na bayɔng fɛ́ ba bi nɔɔk atsak ni wu, na ba di sɛ kutset vit igang. <verse eid="1TI 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 1:17" />Won iratek ni ízɔk ni i sot AGwɔm bágwɔm fɛ́ da a ku awo, ba ku di awo, azizɛɛt Adakunom ayɛ ne ayɛ. Anɔng.<verse eid="1TI 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 1:18" />Ari hom aTimoti, in tsin da won itabak yeng, kpaf ni itaas-ibes fɛ́ ba kin nye naton ngɔn, nɔng ki i di kuus iye, i da sɛ agap ira itsom itek. <verse eid="1TI 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 1:19" />Nyeseng gak ayɛt inɔɔk atsak ni kuyiring kutek. Bakak mi raba ifok itabak iyɛ bá, nek anɔng ba mi beseng inɔɔk atsak bá. <verse eid="1TI 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 1:20" />Ayɛt ba yet aHimeniyus, nɛ Alekzanda, fi in mi nabak aShetan ne, a ka ba tees ba bi beseng iyerek Adakunom awo.<verse eid="1TI 1:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TI 2" />
  <para style="s">Irèn iya Adakunom ntong</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 2:1" />Ni itumung e, in shim fɛ̀ ni yin, i se gbing-gbing ni rip yin, ni ras yin awon, ni nyeseng yin nate ayɛt awon ni nesek yin ifeng akuce banet ngma kusum, <verse eid="1TI 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 2:2" />akuce bágwɔm nɛ bayɔng fɛ́ ba bɛ kukyem, nɔng in di sɛ yit kusot kukyang ni imen iyɛ ayɛt ikuus Kunom ni kusot kutek kaakyi izen. <verse eid="1TI 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 2:3" />Anɔng e se gyat, i terek Adakunom Anet-Isheshek yit iyɛ, <verse eid="1TI 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 2:4" />iwu fɛ́ a ishim banet ngma na ba sɛ isheshek, nɛ ba sɛ irēn atsak e. <verse eid="1TI 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 2:5" />Nek Adakunom yet azining, anet fɛ́ a nyeseng nate Adakunom nɛ banet yet azining, anet e yet Anet-Isheshek aYeso, <verse eid="1TI 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 2:6" />iwu wu fɛ́ a nɔɔk ice wu ti itarang ibisik banet ngma. Anɔng e tonong dɛdɛt fok Adakunom shim a shan banet ngma. <verse eid="1TI 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 2:7" />Nek anɔng wu fɛ́ ba di kasa mo ni sot anet itom nɛ atom aYeso. In tsin ki tas yin katsak, In tsin ki tas yin abɔɔs awo, imi yet anet itees atitup inɔɔk atsak sak ni Ícɛn-iduk.<verse eid="1TI 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 2:8" />Imi shim batek kaakɛ na ba nasap mbɔk in jɛrɛ ayɛt awon, vit ibeseng iyɛ ke nanan awo.<verse eid="1TI 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 2:9" />Imi ti in shim banyining na ba tes ares ni irèn fi i se gyat, ni nkpin fi in se gyatgyat, da na a bat ice ke na ata itsɔm asɛng ke na ata itsɔm akan ke na ares itsɔm awo, <verse eid="1TI 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 2:10" />tit na ba sot bafi ntomong ntek, nyɔng fi in se gyat na banyining fɛ́ ba nesek iratek na Adakunom na ba ku ya ntong.<verse eid="1TI 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 2:11" />Won abining na a sot afi-imɛɛs nkyɔrɔk ayɛt imen nhwyɛ ni inabak ice. <verse eid="1TI 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 2:12" />Da imi nɔɔk irèn abining na a tees, ke na a bi ice naton amatek awo; won na te yuu. <verse eid="1TI 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 2:13" />Nek ba kin tun nye Adamu, ama anɔng aHauwa. <verse eid="1TI 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 2:14" />Da ayet Adamu wu fɛ́ ba kin ku wɔrɔk awo, a kin yet abining e wu fɛ́ ba kin ku wɔrɔk, fɛ́ a kpa ni inɛn. <verse eid="1TI 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 2:15" />Ngma na anɔng, banyining da sɛ isheshek nek kutes nnon, kɛ ba ya kashon ayɛt inɔɔk atsak, ni ishim, ni kusot ajɛrɛ, ni itot ice.<verse eid="1TI 2:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TI 3" />
  <para style="s">Nggɔn fi in se yɛɛt <optbreak /> nek akɔk-ashon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 3:1" />Ifɛ̀ deng yet atsak: ke akak mi te iyɛ wu a shim a sot anet iyere bafi ikuus, a tsin tsɛt kutomong kutek. <verse eid="1TI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 3:2" />I se gbing-gbing afi iyere bafi ikuus na sot vit ikyɛng icɛɛt azaton wu. Anet fɛ́ a bereng abining wu na atsak, anet nhwyɛ, afi itekap kurɔm. Ayɔng fɛ́ ba ku nesek iratek, afi ishashang batsen. Ayɔng fɛ́ a kyem a tees bakak. <verse eid="1TI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 3:3" />Da na a yet ayɔng fɛ́ a nɔɔk ice ni isɔ awo, da ayɔng fɛ́ a tsɛsɛk ifa awo tit afi nhwyɛ, da ayɔng fɛ́ a mak iwɔng awo, da afi ishim itsɔm awo. <verse eid="1TI 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 3:4" />I se gbing-gbing na yet ayɔng fɛ́ a kyem a bɛrɛng kari wu gyat, ayɔng fi nnon wu ku foos ifɛ̀ na ba ku nesek iratek. <verse eid="1TI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 3:5" />(Ke da anet da kyem bɛrɛng kari wu awo, a da nye nɛ na bɛrɛng banet Adakunom ɛ?) <verse eid="1TI 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 3:6" />Da a bi yet anet yɔng fɛ́ a mɛsɛng shan atsak awo, kɔng a bi kpa kok ice, na bɛ na kpa ni ishɔt kyɔn tɛ aShetan kin di kpa. <verse eid="1TI 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 3:7" />I se gbing-gbing banet amatse na ba tere nggɔn wu, kɔng a bi kpa ayɛt nsum, na kpa ayɛt agunung aShetan.<verse eid="1TI 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 3:8" />Kpaf anɔng, won bashɔn bafi ikuus na ba sot bayɔng fɛ́ banet ka ba nesek iratek, bafɛ́ atsak, da banet fɛ́ ba dung sɔ ashi anap awo, ke na ba sot bayɔng fɛ́ ba dung tsɛsɛk itsɔm awo. <verse eid="1TI 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 3:9" />I se gbing-gbing na bereng atsak atsik afi inɔɔk atsak ni kuyiring fok ishɔt mi ka ba ya awo. <verse eid="1TI 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 3:10" />I se gbing-gbing na ba tun ka ba mara ninyɛn; ke ba sɛ vit inɛn, won na ba sot bashɔn bafi ikuus e.<verse eid="1TI 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 3:11" />Kpaf anɔng ba, won banyining, ne ba sot banyining fɛ́ ba nyes nggɔn fi in kyem ba ka ba nesek mo iratek, da ba bi sot bafi ncɛɛt abap awo, tit bafi nhwyɛ, bayɔng fɛ́ ba kyem na ba di te iyɛ ni ba.<verse eid="1TI 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 3:12" />I se gbing-gbing ashɔn bafi ikuus na a yet amatek abining azining, i se gbing-gbing na a kyem a bereng nnon wu, na kunung kari wu yɛɛt. <verse eid="1TI 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 3:13" />Bayɔng fɛ́ ba ra kutomong ishɔn bafi ikuus gyat, ba sɛs iyerek itek, ba cɛɛt ni iyɛ izining naton isɛ atsak bà na Anet-Isheshek aYeso.<verse eid="1TI 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 3:14" />Ayet fok ngmash ni in bɛ azɔng, in tsin da jɛk nkyɔrɔk ira nang nɔng, <verse eid="1TI 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 3:15" />ki in beseng izen, ni ngɔn rēn irèn fɛ́ banet di ki nye kusot ari Adakunom, fi in yet atsok ni itis atsak. <verse eid="1TI 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 3:16" />Nkyɔrɔk yɔng fi in tsang se ni nɛt yet nratek ni irèn ikuus yit in se ane,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">Anet-Isheshek aYeso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 3:16">a bɛ azatse ni nse anet,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 3:16">Kabik Adakunom tonong,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 3:16">fok a se tabat,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">batomaza kin ku di,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 3:16">ba shara ifɛ̀ wu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 3:16">sak na banet ngma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">banet azatse nɔɔk atsak ni wu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 3:16">ba kin ku sok</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 3:16">sak azanɛn ayɛt ízɔk.<verse eid="1TI 3:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TI 4" />
  <para style="s">Bafi itees mbɔɔs</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 4:1" />Kabik Adakunom mi tak wɛshɛk fok ni izen igang azatse bakak bi wosong inɔɔk atsak ba nfi ikuus ne ba nɔɔk nhwyɛ ba sak na naban nabik na fi mbɔɔs ni itees mbɔɔs nfi itséng. <verse eid="1TI 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 4:2" />Kuri itees iyeng nes ne bafɛ́ nanu nafifa bafi itees mbɔɔs, fɛ́ ayɛ ba mi kus, tɛ ba shosh ni kutsɔm fɛ́ ba tun iko ni irong. <verse eid="1TI 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 4:3" />Kuri banet e ban ba ro banet ni ira kuweneng ni iya nayak nakak. Adakunom wu fɛ́ a nye ngma kuyak nek bayɔng fɛ́ ba nɔɔk atsak, ba tɛ ba irēn atsak e, ne ba shan ina ni ifeng. <verse eid="1TI 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 4:4" />Nek kaakyi ikyɛng fɛ́ Adakunom nye ise yɛɛt, da na ba raye ikyikak awo, ki ba mi tsang shan iye ni ifeng, <verse eid="1TI 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 4:5" />nek ifɛ̀ Adakunom nɛ awon mi sak ide i sot jɛrɛ.<verse eid="1TI 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 4:6" />Ki i itees barunyining nkyɔrɔk nang, i da sot anet itomong Anet-Isheshek aYeso atek, ayɔng fɛ́ a sɛ itees atsak ifi nɔɔk atsak, ni itees itek fi ngɔn tsin di kuus. <verse eid="1TI 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 4:7" />I bi won ikikak da moon ni nkyɛng-ashon ashon abap ni ncɛɛt ányáko awo, tit tees ice ngɔn kusot nggɔn Adakunom. <verse eid="1TI 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 4:8" />Nek itiri kurɔm bɛ itek de gyeet, awɛt kusot fɛ́ Adakunom shim bi itek ni nkyɔrɔk ngma, ku bes ni itek ni kuzam ku kang ni kuyɔng fi ku bi bɛ.<verse eid="1TI 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 4:9" />Ifɛ̀ de yet atsak, fi i se yɛɛt ni in shan ni iyɛ izining, <verse eid="1TI 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 4:10" />(nek ide fi in di ngu yit ice ni di bɔrɔng yit), nek in mi te yit iyɛ na Adakunom atset, iwu fɛ́ a yet Anet-Isheshek banet ngma, amak e bayɔng fɛ́ ba nɔɔk atsak.<verse eid="1TI 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 4:11" />Ka ba tas ni ka ba tees nkyɔrɔk nang. <verse eid="1TI 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 4:12" />I bi won akak na da byɛs nek i yet acam awo, tit sot ikyɛng fɛ́ banet ikuus da mɛɛs ayɛt icɛɛt ngɔn, ni kusot ngɔn, ayɛt ishim, ayɛt inɔɔk atsak ni kusot kucɛ́l. <verse eid="1TI 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 4:13" />Ni tsin di tot kubɛ́ hom, nabak ice ngɔn ni ifaa banet kufumung ajɛrɛ, ni ishara ifɛ̀ itek ni itees banet. <verse eid="1TI 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 4:14" />I bi rɔrɔ ni kunang ngɔn awo, fi i kin sɛ iko ni itak abes ni izen fɛ́ bashɔn bafi ikuus kin di sak mbɔk naton ngɔn.<verse eid="1TI 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 4:15" />Te nhwyɛ ngɔn ni nkyɔrɔk nang; nabak ice ngɔn kusum ni na, nɔng kaangan da di iya kashon ngɔn. <verse eid="1TI 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 4:16" />Nye yɛɛt ni ice ngɔn ni itees ngɔn. Te nyɛk ni ira na, nek ki i nye nɔng, i da sheshek ice ngɔn nɛ bafi ifoos ngɔn.<verse eid="1TI 4:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TI 5" />
  <para style="s">Itabak naton bakuma, <optbreak /> bashɔn nɛ basám</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 5:1" />I bi gyɔng ashɔn awo, tit ku tabak tɛ a yet ada ngɔn. Nye na bacam tɛ barunyining, <verse eid="1TI 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 5:2" />ni nye na banyining bako ti binggɔ ngɔn, ni nye na banyining bawosong tɛ banganyining ayɛt irèn gyat makiyi.<verse eid="1TI 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 5:3" />Te nhwyɛ ngɔn na bakuma fɛ́ ba bɛ atitup kudaam. <verse eid="1TI 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 5:4" />Awɛt ke akuma bi nnon ke babon wu ayi, won na ba kpa mara nggɔn ikuus bà ni igbingding kari bà, na anɔng wu fɛ́ ba di ki tarang báték nɛ badakop bà, nek anɔng e terek Adakunom iyɛ. <verse eid="1TI 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 5:5" />Akuma fɛ́ a bɛ atitup kudaam, vit anet fɛ́ a da ku gbingding, a te iyɛ wu na Adakunom, na ya kashon na awon kunom na katuk, nek Adakunom ku sɛ mo. <verse eid="1TI 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 5:6" />Awɛt akuma fi a tsɛsɛk nta kyek, a mi ku, ngma na fɛ́ a resek mo ni kutset. <verse eid="1TI 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 5:7" />Nesek banet e itabak yeng, kɔn ba bi cɛɛt naton ba. <verse eid="1TI 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 5:8" />Ngma anet fɛ́ da a kyɛm a nesek bafi izit wu awo, amak e bafɛ́ ari wu, a mi tone ni inɔɔk atsak wu, ibeseng wu wat ifi nhwyi.<verse eid="1TI 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 5:9" />Vit akuma fi iyerek wu da nɔ ayɛt ayerek bakuma, ma ayɛ wu tsa nsɔk karataat ninyɛn, a kin se ayɛt kusot kutek na amatek mo ni kutset, <verse eid="1TI 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 5:10" />ba ku rēn ni nggɔn ntek, ti ita nnon, ishashang batsen, ikus atak batsen, igbingding bafi mgbang ni inabak ice ni iras kaakyi ntomong ntek.<verse eid="1TI 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 5:11" />I bi te ayerek bakuma bawosong ayɛt kufumung e awo, nek izen fi ikɔk irɔm bà nyɔrɔk inabak ice bà ni ikuus Anet-Isheshek, ba da shim kuweneng. <verse eid="1TI 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 5:12" />Na anɔng, na ba di kɔrɔk ice bá ishɔt, na ba beseng kushi fɛ́ ba kin tsang sok. <verse eid="1TI 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 5:13" />Na anɔng, na ba nɔ ayɛt kusosok arut, na ba teng ba kuus nasa. Da kusosok arut kyek awo, wɛt na ba nɔ iteng anu, ni nrɔm bá hwyan, na ba tas nkyɔrɔk fi in se kpaf awo. <verse eid="1TI 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 5:14" />Nek anɔng, imi nesek bakuma bawosong itabak, na ba ras nweneng, na ba tes nnon, na ba bereng nasa bá gyat, kɔn ba bi nɔɔk afi ifaa yit kawat ncɛɛt nmaane. <verse eid="1TI 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 5:15" />Bakak ayɛt bà mi tirik kama ba won irèn sak ikuus aShetan.<verse eid="1TI 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 5:16" />Ke abining akak fɛ́ a yet afi ikuus, bɛ akuma ari wu, na a ku sɛ mo, a bi won bafi ikuus ni kunanang ni iba awo, nɔng bafi ikuus di ki sɛ bayɔng fɛ́ da ba bɛ anet awo.<verse eid="1TI 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 5:17" />Bashɔn bafi ikuus fɛ́ ba ras kutomong nate bafi ikuus gyat, ba kyem na ba ka ba nɔɔk iratek makiyi, amak e bayɔng fi kutomong bà yet ishara ifɛ̀ ni itees banet. <verse eid="1TI 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 5:18" />Nek kufumung ajɛrɛ fɛ̀ ye, &lt;&lt;Ba bi faam kanu amung ni i tsin ra kutomong awo.&gt;&gt; Nɛ, &lt;&lt;Anet itomong kyem na ba ku nɔɔk itarang wu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1TI 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 5:19" />I bi wes ato ni kucɛɛt fɛ́ ba bene naton ashɔn awo tit ma banet tsa bafaa sak bataat fɛ́ ba bene. <verse eid="1TI 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 5:20" />Bayɔng fɛ́ ba nye inɛn, won na ba ka ba tabak nate banet, nɔng ishɛrɛp banet di ki fok nnyim.<verse eid="1TI 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TI 5:21" />In tsin cɛɛt ni ngɔn ashon Adakunom, nɛ Anet-Isheshek aYeso, nɛ ashon batomaza fɛ́ ba mi kasa, bereng itabak yeng vit ishim ice, i bi nye ikikak ayɛt ikasa awo.<verse eid="1TI 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TI 5:22" />I bi saas mbɔk naton banet ziri ziri awo, i bi sɔɔn ice ngɔn na anɛn bakak awo. Bereng ice ngɔn cɛ́l.<verse eid="1TI 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TI 5:23" />Won isɔ ashi wɔɔn na, di moon na ashi anap gyet nek kafa irɔk ngɔn, ni kurɔm ngɔn fi ku doro kaakyi izen.<verse eid="1TI 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TI 5:24" />Anɛn banet bakak mi wuruk dɛdɛt, a mi ta narɔ ishɔt ashon ba; anɛn afɛ́ banet bakak ne a nes ama bà. <verse eid="1TI 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TI 5:25" />Kpaf anɔng, ntomong ntek se wɛshɛk, ngma ni nyɔng fɛ́ ba nyes ni nɛt, ba da kyem ba nɛt ina awo.<verse eid="1TI 5:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1TI 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 6:1" />Won ngma bayɔng fɛ́ ba se nawop isam na ba nesek batek ari bà iratek, kɔng iyerek Adakunom ni itees yit da sɛ ibeseng. <verse eid="1TI 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 6:2" />Bayɔng fɛ́ batek ari bá yet bafi ikuus, ba bi ka ba byɛs fok nek ba yet bafi ikuus awo. Idung se yɛɛt na ba ka nye ikyɛng itek ningya, nek bayɔng fɛ́ ba tsin ya itek kutomong bá yet bafi ikuus, baruneng bá. Nkyɔrɔk nang fi i da ka ba tees ni ka ba tabak mo.<verse eid="1TI 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ishim itsɔm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 6:3" />Ke akak tees itees mbɔɔs na rawu dang shan itees atsak ifɛ́ aTisa yit aYeso Kristi ni itees irèn ikuus yit, <verse eid="1TI 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 6:4" />anet e yɔng bi ikok ice, a rēn ikikak awo. A bɛ̀ nggɔn nmaane nfi itsɛt nanan, ni ishesheng ncɛɛt. Kuri nggɔn yɔng na fi in bes ni ifup, ni ifa ni itok ni ncɛɛt nmaane, <verse eid="1TI 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 6:5" />iwoso kɔk nanan na bayɔng ba bɛ kuyiring abap, nek atsak mi ka ba won. Banet kuri bayɔng di tɛ ikuus Adakunom yet irèn i sɛ kurúm.<verse eid="1TI 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 6:6" />Awɛt ikuus Adakunom ni imen iyɛ ni ikyɛng fi i bɛ́ yet kurúm gyet awo. <verse eid="1TI 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 6:7" />Nek in bɛ́ yit azatse ni mbɔk nkoot, vit ikyɛng fi in da tseng yit ne. <verse eid="1TI 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 6:8" />Awɛt ki in bɛ̀ yit nayak nɛ ares, won ayɛ yit ni imen na anɔng. <verse eid="1TI 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 6:9" />Banet fɛ́ ba tsɛsɛk ite kurúm, bá kpas ayɛt imara ne ayɛt agunung, ni iras ishɔp ni ikɔk iras nkyɔrɔk fi in tes banet beseng na ba wey. <verse eid="1TI 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 6:10" />Nek ishim itsɔm yet itsiip akaakyɛ ikyɛng imaan e. Bakak nek ishim kurúm, ba mi won irèn atsak, ba mi kɔrɔk ace bá kafa kawe makiyi.<verse eid="1TI 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Itabak aBulus <optbreak /> sak na aTimoti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 6:11" />Awɛt ngɔn, anet Adakunom, teng ngɔn nkyɔrɔk yɔng ngma, di kuus kusot kutabat, ni nggɔn fɛ́ Adakunom shim, ni inɔɔk atsak, ni i shim, ni inye gbingding, ni nhwyɛ. <verse eid="1TI 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 6:12" />Won kuren ngɔn ni ku yet kuren kutek kufi ibereng atsak. Tekap kutset fi ku se vit igang yɔng fɛ́ ba kin da yes mo ayɛt ko ni izen fi ngɔn kin nye kucɛɛt kutek ashon banet dot. <verse eid="1TI 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 6:13" />In tsin cɛɛt ni ngɔn ashon Adakunom fɛ́ a nesek kaakyi ikyɛng kutset, nɛ ashon Anet-Isheshek aYeso, ayɔng fi ni izen fɛ́ a kin nɔɔk kanu icɛɛt ashon aBilatus aPontiyus, a kin nye kucɛɛt kutek. <verse eid="1TI 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 6:14" />Bereng ifɛ̀ deng vit karìk ki ikyɛng icɛɛt awo sak izen fɛ́ aTisa yit aYeso Kristi bi di bɛ́s wu. <verse eid="1TI 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 6:15" />Adakunom bi bɛ́ ni wu, na kpaf izen fi iwu mi sak, atek awɛng nɛ azizɛɛt agwɔm, agwɔm bágwɔm nɛ aTisa bátisa. <verse eid="1TI 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 6:16" />Iwu kyɛk fɛ́ da a ku awo, fɛ́ a se ayɛt mgbey fɛ́ vit ayɔng fɛ́ a kyɛm bɛ bakat ni ina, fɛ́ vit ayɔng fɛ́ a mang di ke a kyem a di awo. Won ba ku nesek iratek nɛ agap ayɛ na ayɛ. Anɔng.<verse eid="1TI 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 6:17" />Fɛ ne bayɔng fɛ́ ba bɛ kurúm azatse kang, da ba bi kok ice ba awo ke na ba te iyɛ ni kurúm fɛ́ anet kyem a di sak iyɛ awo, tit na ba te iyɛ bá na Adakunom, iwu fɛ́ a ki nesek yit shɛrɛk kaakyɛ fi in shim yit. <verse eid="1TI 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 6:18" />Fɛ ni iba, na ba ras itek, kurum ba ni ku yet kufi iras ntomong ntek, na ba sot ni mbɔk washak, na ba di sɛs bakak. <verse eid="1TI 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 6:19" />Ayɛt anɔng wu fɛ́ ba di ki tusung ace bá kurúm, ni ita itis agap ni kuzam fi ku bi bɛ́, na anɔng wu fɛ́ ba bi sɛ kutset fi ku yet atitup kutset.<verse eid="1TI 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 6:20" />ATimoti, bereng ikyɛng fɛ́ ba mi won ni bɔk ngɔn gyat. Fam ato ngɔn ni ifoos ncɛɛt abap, nɛ nanan abap fɛ́ ba di boroso banet fok irēn, <verse eid="1TI 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TI 6:21" />fɛ́ bakak mi shan iye, na anɔng wu inɔɔk atsak bá teng i di tirisi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TI 6:21">Won itek Adakunom ni i sɛ gung ni ngɔn.<verse eid="1TI 6:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 6" />
</usx>